动，远端环境不会带上这些改动。\",\n    \"branch_different\": \"本地当前分支与远端环境记录的分支不同，需要先决定派遣时使用哪个分支。\",\n    \"sync_diff\": \"本地与远端代码仓库状态不一致，需要先决定是否同步。\",\n    \"generic\": \"需要先处理当前代码仓库状态，才能继续发起派遣至远端。\"\n  },\n  \"goal\": {\n    \"dirty_same\": \"帮我处理本地未提交的改动（提交并推送，或暂存），让工作区恢复到可继续派遣的状态。\",\n    \"branch_different\": \"帮我决定是使用本地分支还是继续使用云端分支，并按需要同步到远端代码仓库。\",\n    \"no_named_branch\": \"帮我处理当前 detached HEAD 状态，并决定是否继续使用云端分支派遣。\",\n    \"generic\": \"帮我把本地代码仓库整理到可以继续发起派遣至远端的状态。\"\n  },\n  \"unknown\": \"（未知）\"\n}\n","project_task.handoff.wip_content":"此功能正在开发中，敬请期待！","project_task.handoff.wip_title":"功能开发中","project_task.handoff_down.error.auth_failed.desc":"没有权限访问代码仓库，可能是凭证已过期。","project_task.handoff_down.error.auth_failed.hint":"请在终端中重新配置 SSH Key 或重新登录。","project_task.handoff_down.error.auth_failed.title":"认证失败","project_task.handoff_down.error.cancelled.desc":"Handoff 操作已被取消。","project_task.handoff_down.error.cancelled.hint":"准备好后可以重新尝试。","project_task.handoff_down.error.cancelled.title":"Handoff 已取消","project_task.handoff_down.error.conflict.desc":"本地修改与远端代码存在冲突。","project_task.handoff_down.error.conflict.hint":"请在编辑器中手动解决冲突后再试。","project_task.handoff_down.error.conflict.title":"代码存在冲突","project_task.handoff_down.error.network_error.desc":"无法连接到代码仓库服务器。","project_task.handoff_down.error.network_error.hint":"请检查网络设置或稍后再试。","project_task.handoff_down.error.network_error.title":"网络连接失败","project_task.handoff_down.error.not_found.desc":"目标分支在远端仓库中未找到。","project_task.handoff_down.error.not_found.hint":"请确认分支名称是否正确。","project_task.handoff_down.error.not_found.title":"分支不存在","project_task.handoff_down.error.rejected.desc":"远端有更新的提交，无法直接推送。","project_task.handoff_down.error.rejected.hint":"请先拉取最新代码再尝试。","project_task.handoff_down.error.rejected.title":"推送被拒绝","project_task.handoff_down.error.timeout.desc":"与代码仓库的连接耗时过长，可能是网络不稳定。","project_task.handoff_down.error.timeout.hint":"请检查网络连接后重新尝试。","project_task.handoff_down.error.timeout.title":"操作超时","project_task.handoff_down.error.unknown.des